  "description": "TUnit-native fluent time-assertion DSL on FakeTimeProvider plus an assertion-level timing budget chain extension via [AssertionExtension]. Provides Assert.That(fakeTime).HasAdvanced(...) / HasUtcNow(...), Assert.That(timestamp).IsRecent(...) / IsBeforeNow(...) / IsAfterNow(...), and the cross-cutting Assert.That(value).IsX().And.WithinTimeBudget(TimeSpan) on any TUnit assertion chain. Composes with sibling assertion packages without a binary dependency. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no reflection.",
